==Battleground==
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 8~10 seconds<sup>240f~300f</sup>.
*2 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Doctor K.O.]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Marquis Clionius]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**3 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**10 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Red EnerG]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A classic rush strategy is the key to this stage. Use high-DPS rushers like Talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] to kill Clionus before the Red Ener-g arrives. [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] can shave off massive amounts of HP in shield, and [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Rapper Cat]] can wall the enemies even without research combos.

Start the stage off as you would normally, deploying [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cats]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]]s to counter the startoff enemies. When you start to push to the base, deploy your rushers and keep them alive inside Clionus’ blind spot. He should die before Red Ener-g shows up, at which point you can just chip him down with anti-Surge units.

